#: ../../agents/index.rst:97
msgid ""
"ANet, the plugins and the Trae bundle run on Linux, macOS and Windows. "
"Every plugin carries the launchers of both systems: POSIX shell scripts "
"for Linux and macOS, and ``.cmd`` scripts that run Windows PowerShell "
"5.1, which is part of Windows, for Windows. On Windows, install ANet with"
" the PowerShell installer (:ref:`intro-install-windows`), or let the "
"setup skill of a plugin run that installer after the user agrees. The "
"Windows launch of each plugin was established from the sources of the "
"tool, and the Windows runners are tested with PowerShell; the tools "
"themselves were not run on Windows. How far the steps of a page were "
"verified differs by tool: each page states what was run in the tool "
"itself, what was run only with a stand-in for the tool or against the "
"generated files, and what was not tested, including macOS and the "
"graphical clients. The command ``anet agents wire --all`` registers every"
" tool of the table that it supports and detects, and leaves the others "
"unchanged. It changes only the tools for which a registration command is "
"listed."
msgstr ""
"ANet、各插件和 Trae 安装包均可在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上运行。每个插件都带有两类系统的启动脚本：用于 Linux"
" 和 macOS 的 POSIX shell 脚本，以及用于 Windows 的 ``.cmd`` 脚本，后者运行 Windows 自带的 "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1。在 Windows 上，请使用 PowerShell 安装程序安装 ANet（:ref"
":`intro-install-windows`），或在用户同意后由插件的设置技能运行该安装程序。各插件在 Windows "
"上的启动方式依据相应工具的源代码确定，Windows 运行脚本已用 PowerShell 测试；这些工具本身未在 Windows "
"上运行。各页步骤的验证程度因工具而异：每页都会说明哪些步骤在工具本身中运行过，哪些仅借助工具的替代程序或针对生成的文件运行过，以及哪些未经测试，包括"
" macOS 和图形客户端。命令 ``anet agents wire --all`` "
"会登记表中它所支持且检测到的每个工具，其他工具保持不变；它只修改列出了登记命令的工具。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:111
msgid ""
"A plugin is an alternative to ``anet agents wire``, not an addition to "
"it. A plugin registers the MCP server and installs the operating guide, a"
" setup procedure and a status check through the mechanism of the tool "
"itself, and it can install ``anet`` after the user agrees. Use one of the"
" two routes for a tool, because both register a server with the name "
"``anet``; each page says how to remove the other registration, and, for "
"opencode, how the two coexist. The plugins are generated from one source "
"(``deploy/plugins`` in the ANet repository), so they share the runner "
"script that selects the executable and the identity."
msgstr ""
"插件是 ``anet agents wire`` 的替代方式，而非补充。插件通过工具自身的机制登记 MCP "
"服务器，并安装操作指南、配置流程和状态检查，还可在用户同意后安装 ``anet``。同一工具请只选用其中一种方式，因为两者都会登记名为 "
"``anet`` 的服务器；各页说明了如何移除另一种登记，opencode 一页还说明两者如何共存。各插件由同一份源码生成（ANet 仓库中的 "
"``deploy/plugins``），因此共用选择可执行文件与身份的运行脚本。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:120
msgid ""
"All plugins have the version 0.2.0, which is their final version. A "
"plugin carries no list of tools, no ANet version and no setup steps. Its "
"skills direct the agent to the guide of the installed ``anet``: the MCP "
"tool ``guide`` of ``anet mcp``, with an optional ``topic``, and the "
"command ``anet guide [<topic>]``. The topics ``overview``, ``setup`` and "
"``status`` always exist. A new release of ANet therefore reaches the "
"tools through the installed executable alone, and the plugins need no "
"update."
msgstr ""
"所有插件的版本均为 0.2.0，这也是其最终版本。插件不携带工具列表、ANet 版本或设置步骤。其技能引导 Agent 阅读已安装 "
"``anet`` 的指南：即 ``anet mcp`` 的 MCP 工具 ``guide``\\ （可选参数 ``topic``）以及命令 "
"``anet guide [<topic>]``。主题 ``overview``、``setup`` 和 ``status`` "
"始终存在。因此，ANet 的新版本仅凭已安装的可执行文件即可作用于各工具，插件无需更新。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:128
msgid ""
"Where the tool has commands or skills that the user can invoke, a plugin "
"provides the entry point ``/anet``. It carries out an ``@anet`` request "
"as the guide of the installed ``anet`` describes; without a request, it "
"shows the tasks that other agents sent to the node and the state of the "
"node. A status command or skill, ``anet-status``, reports the state of "
"the node. Each page names the exact form of both in that tool."
msgstr ""
"若工具提供用户可调用的命令或技能，插件会提供入口 ``/anet``。它按已安装 ``anet`` 的指南所述执行 ``@anet`` "
"请求；未给出请求时，显示其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务以及节点状态。状态命令或技能 ``anet-status`` "
"报告节点状态。各页给出两者在相应工具中的确切形式。"

#: ../../agents/index.rst:135
msgid ""
"The setup skill ``anet-setup`` of a plugin finds the runner, runs it with"
" ``--resolve``, installs ANet only with the consent of the user (``bin"
"/anet-install.sh`` on Linux and macOS, ``bin/anet-install.cmd`` on "
"Windows; both run the official installer) and then follows ``<runner> "
"guide setup``. The runner (``bin/anet-run.sh``, or ``bin/anet-run.cmd`` "
"on Windows) applies the same rules on both systems. A configured "
"``anetPath`` must be the absolute path of an executable (``anet.exe`` on "
"Windows) and is never replaced by another copy. Without it, the absolute "
"directories of ``PATH`` are searched, then ``~/.local/bin``, "
"``/usr/local/bin`` and ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` on Linux and macOS, or "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``, ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` and "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin`` on Windows. The working directory and the "
"workspace are never searched, and identity names are validated. "
"``<runner> --resolve`` prints the executable, its version, the identity "
"and the command line of the runner."
msgstr ""
"插件的设置技能 ``anet-setup`` 查找运行脚本，以 ``--resolve`` 运行它，仅在用户同意时安装 ANet（Linux 和 "
"macOS 上为 ``bin/anet-install.sh``，Windows 上为 ``bin/anet-"
"install.cmd``，两者均运行官方安装程序），随后按 ``<runner> guide setup`` 执行。运行脚本（``bin"
"/anet-run.sh``，Windows 上为 ``bin/anet-run.cmd``）在两类系统上遵循相同的规则。所配置的 "
"``anetPath`` 必须是可执行文件的绝对路径（Windows 上为 ``anet.exe``），且从不改用其他副本。未配置时，先在 "
"``PATH`` 的绝对路径目录中查找，然后在 Linux 和 macOS 上依次查找 "
"``~/.local/bin``、``/usr/local/bin`` 和 ``/opt/homebrew/bin``，在 Windows "
"上依次查找 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``、``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin`` 和 "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``。从不在工作目录或工作区中查找，身份名称会经过校验。``<runner> "
"--resolve`` 输出可执行文件、其版本、身份以及运行脚本的命令行。"

